== Usage ==
Upon reaching {{Green|150}} bonus {{stat|rt}} and {{stat|hp}}, '''Discrite''' evolves into '''Spotlite''' with the following message:

{{Dialogue|&d&lEVOLUTION! &dYour &9Discrite &dhas evolved!}}

Consuming '''Spotlite''' grants {{stat|rt|150}} and {{stat|hp|150}}, for {{Green|60 minutes}}. It also grants a permanent {{stat|rt|25}} and {{stat|hp|5}}. The permanent buff can only be applied {{Green|5}} times.

It gains {{stat|rt|0.5}} and {{stat|hp|0.5}} every hour, taking {{Green|300}} hours to reach the maximum buff of {{Green|150}} bonus {{stat|rt}} and {{stat|hp}}. {{Aging Items Process}}

One '''Discrite''' is also used to upgrade the {{Item|Time Pocket}} from {{Green|6}} slots to {{Green|9}} slots and one '''Spotlite''' is used to upgrade it from {{Green|9}} slots to {{Green|12}} slots.

